[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 668.87, "timestamp": "00:11:08", "text": "這裡有一段停頓，就像你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 672.47, "timestamp": "00:11:12", "text": "知道的，不是在她之前，而是在她之後，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 680.069, "timestamp": "00:11:20", "text": "基本上是的，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 690.23, "timestamp": "00:11:30", "text": "這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 693.03, "timestamp": "00:11:33", "text": "像破折號還是像普通的減號？  是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 695.11, "timestamp": "00:11:35", "text": "啊，普通衝刺也太可愛了吧。  我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 699.35, "timestamp": "00:11:39", "text": "只要你知道這是禁食。  知道了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 703.035, "timestamp": "00:11:43", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hahah"}]